## Input

```css
@media (aspect-ratio: 16/9) {
  .ratio { display: block; }
}
@media (400px < width < 900px) {
  .range { display: block; }
}
@media (min-width: calc(100vw - 1px)) {
  .calc { display: block; }
}
@container (aspect-ratio: 16/9) and (400px < width < 900px) {
  .size { display: block; }
}
@container style(--tokens: 16/9) {
  .raw { display: block; }
}

